      "primary_message": "Whisk together buttermilk, mayonnaise, mustard, vinegar, and sugar. Pour over cabbage and season generously with black pepper. Toss to combine and season with more salt and pepper as desired. Transfer to refrigerator and let rest for 30 minutes or up to 3 days before serving.",
